shape: sequence
Client -> "Copier Agent": copy(scope, sources, destination)
"Copier Agent" -> "Filesystem Copy Resolver": resolve(scope, sources, destination)
"Filesystem Copy Resolver" -> "std::fs Provider": validate & copy entries
"Filesystem Copy Resolver" --> "Copier Agent": Result<(), CopyError>
"Copier Agent" --> Client: Result<(), CopyError>
